<title>UK: Atmel sets $150 mln five-year convertible.</title>
<headline>Atmel sets $150 mln five-year convertible.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-05-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by lead manager Deutsche Morgan Grenfell.</p>
<p>BORROWER  *ATMEL S.A</p>
<p> AMT    $150 MLN	COUPON   **3.25	MATURITY    ***2002</p>
<p> TYPE   CONVERTIBLE   ISS PRICE  PAR	 IND PREMIUM 42-45 PCT</p>
<p> NOTES	*SUBSIDIARY OF ATMEL CORP</p>
<p>	     **STEPS-UP TO 8.0-8.5 PCT AFTER YEAR THREE.</p>
<p>	    ***CALLABLE AFTER YEAR THREE SUBJECT TO 140 PCT RULE.</p>
</text>
